  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 oPt Emergency Appeal - Gaza - Food Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNRWA will provide food assistance to 1.1 million people in Gaza, distributing a food basket intended to cover 90 per cent of daily caloric needs. The Agency will expand its cash-for-work (CfW) programme, aiming to maintain over 7,000 active contracts in 2025. CfW roles include guards, cleaners, technicians, social workers, and administrative staff, both in and outside UNRWA-managed shelters. The Agency will also deploy CfW for targeted initiatives like the 2024 polio campaign and align compensation with Gaza Cash Working Group guidelines.</narrative>
  </description>
